'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page five of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 5|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|25|notext}} and 20 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Democracy Protects}}

==Trivia==
The armor's name, “Hero of the Federation,” is likely derived from the subtitle of [https://sonypictures.com/movies/starshiptroopers2heroofthefederation ''Starship Troopers 2: Hero of the Federation''.]

